WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:05.360
We wanted to be kind of an escape— indoor, outdoor Oasis.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:11.180
You know you're going on a little trip. You're not even in the city anymore.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:16.180
Welcome to the first fully operational cannabis restaurant in the United States.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.540
It's a 20,000 square foot former brewery in West Hollywood with a menu that includes

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.580
edibles, joints, high-tech bongs and vapes.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:29.700
What our ultimate goal is is to be able to pair the cannabis with the foods.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.680
Your Flower Host would be like a Sommelier. And we want the food servers to be versed in cannabis as well.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.860
Lily Estanislaus is Lowell Cafe's general manager.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:43.700
She says that even before it opened, Lowell received more than 800 job applications.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.520
Everybody wants to work here and I get it, but we wanted people who

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.020
had experience and not just in smoking.

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.800
That was a lot of what I got is like, hey,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:56.100
I'm an avid smoker, I have so much cannabis experience. I'm like, but have you actually worked

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.580
in a dispensary? How much knowledge do you have?

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:03.460
Opening a cafe that's legal, especially, is very important because it just

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.800
breaks the walls down of negative stigmas that surround

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.120
the subject that is cannabis.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:14.060
Erika Soto, who is an industry veteran,
works as a Flower Host at Lowell Cafe,

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.120
which is like a waitress for weed.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:21.720
When guests arrive, she walks them through their options, explains the effects of carious strains,

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.200
and advises them on proper dosage levels.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:29.920
It's an environment that is loving and peaceful and we all kind of see the veil drop when people get

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:32.260
"stoned", you know, and it's not a violent thing.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:36.940
For now, Lowell could only be located in the city of West Hollywood.

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:41.260
What is it about West Hollywood that is more open to something like this, you think?

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:46.500
They have been on the forefront of just being accepting of everything that needs to be liberated.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.600
West Hollywood is now known as the Mecca of cannabis.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:54.800
There are actually three surrounding dispensary's as we speak, and the further you go into West Hollywood,

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:58.740
the more you're going to find things just like us.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:03.260
Because California requires that all cannabis products be tracked seed to sale,

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.680
and lab tested.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.280
Lowell Cafe isn't allowed to make its
own marijuana infused foods or drinks.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.420
Everything must be pre-packaged.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:15.140
After the Rabbi at a nearby synagogue expressed concern

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:18.500
that her congregants would be bombarded with the odor of weed,

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:24.580
Lowell installed massive air filters and machines that spray a sent neutralizing essential oil called

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.720
Cannabolish, and lighting up a tobacco cigarette is prohibited at Lowell

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.120
in compliance with a West Hollywood law.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:36.300
Lowell Cafe's license is provisional for the
first year, after which the council will decide

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.980
whether to renew it. But in the meantime,

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.700
more weed hospitality shops are coming.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.080
The city has issued licenses to seven additional businesses,

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:50.480
including one that will offer a virtual reality experience, and another a day spa.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.280
Being the first, we want to of course, set the standard and sort of

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:58.640
prove ourselves and prove to everyone else that this is something that can be done.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:03.400
And we can just kind of spread the love through the country. Then that's for sure what we want to do.

